      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-125564",
      ":question/problem": "Find the entry ${b}_{32}$ of the matrix $B$, where \n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The entry ${b}_{32}$ should lie at the intersection of the $3$rd row and $2$nd column. \nSince $B$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, it does not have the $3$rd row. \n\nTherefore, $B$ does not have the entry ${b}_{32}.$"
